{"seq":1,"slug":"lfo-modulation","title":"LFO 与周期调制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/modulation-routing/lfo-modulation","wordCount":1311,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"lfo-与周期调制\">LFO 与周期调制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>低频振荡器（LFO, Low Frequency Oscillator）是合成器中最常用的一类调制源，它把&quot;周期性变化&quot;注入到原本静态的参数上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>亚音频范围</strong>：LFO 工作在 0.01–50 Hz，输出不直接发声，而是控制其他参数随时间周期变化。</li>\n<li><strong>波形决定运动形态</strong>：正弦/三角平滑，方波突变，锯齿渐强急回，S&amp;H 随机跳变。</li>\n<li><strong>同步与自由速率</strong>：与 BPM 同步让调制带上节奏属性，自由速率适合 Vibrato 与硬件漂移模拟。</li>\n<li><strong>目标与深度决定表情</strong>：同一 LFO 接到 Pitch、Cutoff、Amp、Pan 效果完全不同，深度从微调到剧烈。</li>\n<li><strong>Fade-In 让它更自然</strong>：延迟与淡入模拟真实乐器&quot;音符稳定后颤音才出现&quot;的行为。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"lfo-的基本概念与波形\">LFO 的基本概念与波形</h2><p>低频振荡器（LFO, Low Frequency Oscillator）是一个工作在亚音频范围（0.01–50 Hz）的振荡器，用于产生周期性的调制信号。与音频振荡器不同，LFO 的输出不直接作为声音，而是控制其他参数的变化。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LFO</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LFO}(t) = A \\cdot f_{wave}(2\\pi f_{lfo} \\cdot t + \\phi_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LFO</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>波形</th>\n<th>数学</th>\n<th>调制特征</th>\n<th>经典应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正弦</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin(2\\pi ft)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>平滑对称</td>\n<td>Vibrato 颤音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三角</td>\n<td>线性折返</td>\n<td>平滑对称</td>\n<td>Filter sweep</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锯齿上升</td>\n<td>线性上升+归零</td>\n<td>渐强急回</td>\n<td>序列效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锯齿下降</td>\n<td>线性下降+归零</td>\n<td>急起渐弱</td>\n<td>下降扫频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方波</td>\n<td>±1 切换</td>\n<td>突变</td>\n<td>Tremolo/Trill</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S&amp;H (Sample &amp; Hold)</td>\n<td>阶梯随机</td>\n<td>随机跳变</td>\n<td>电子随机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机平滑</td>\n<td>插值随机</td>\n<td>有机漂移</td>\n<td>模拟不稳定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;LFO 振荡器&lt;br/&gt;0.01-50 Hz&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;波形选择&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;正弦&quot;| C[&quot;平滑调制&lt;br/&gt;Vibrato&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;方波&quot;| D[&quot;开关式&lt;br/&gt;Tremolo&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;S&amp;H&quot;| E[&quot;随机阶梯&lt;br/&gt;电子质感&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;调制目标&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"LFO 振荡器&lt;br/&gt;0.01-50 Hz\"] --&gt; B{\"波形选择\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"正弦\"| C[\"平滑调制&lt;br/&gt;Vibrato\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"方波\"| D[\"开关式&lt;br/&gt;Tremolo\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"S&amp;H\"| E[\"随机阶梯&lt;br/&gt;电子质感\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"调制目标\"]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"lfo-的速率与同步\">LFO 的速率与同步</h2><p>LFO 速率（Rate）定义了调制的快慢。在音乐制作中，LFO 通常与歌曲 BPM 同步以产生节奏相关的调制效果：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>BPM</mtext><mn>60</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mtext>节拍细分</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{lfo} = \\frac{\\text{BPM}}{60} \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\text{节拍细分}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BPM</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">节拍细分</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>同步细分</th>\n<th>120 BPM 时频率</th>\n<th>效果周期</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1/1 (全音符)</td>\n<td>0.5 Hz</td>\n<td>2 s</td>\n<td>极慢演化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1/2 (二分)</td>\n<td>1 Hz</td>\n<td>1 s</td>\n<td>慢呼吸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1/4 (四分)</td>\n<td>2 Hz</td>\n<td>500 ms</td>\n<td>节拍同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1/8</td>\n<td>4 Hz</td>\n<td>250 ms</td>\n<td>八分音符律动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1/16</td>\n<td>8 Hz</td>\n<td>125 ms</td>\n<td>紧凑序列感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1/32</td>\n<td>16 Hz</td>\n<td>62.5 ms</td>\n<td>极快/模糊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3/16 (附点八分)</td>\n<td>约 2.67 Hz</td>\n<td>375 ms</td>\n<td>跳跃感/弹跳</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>自由速率（Free Rate）不与 BPM 同步，适合有机感的调制——如模拟 Vibrato（通常 5–7 Hz）或模拟硬件的轻微不稳定漂移（0.1–0.5 Hz）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lfo-调制目标与深度\">LFO 调制目标与深度</h2><p>LFO 的表现力完全取决于它调制什么参数以及多大深度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>深度小</th>\n<th>深度中</th>\n<th>深度大</th>\n<th>音频速率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pitch</td>\n<td>轻微 Vibrato</td>\n<td>明显颤音</td>\n<td>警笛/特效</td>\n<td>FM 合成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Filter Cutoff</td>\n<td>温和扫频</td>\n<td>自动 Wah</td>\n<td>剧烈开合</td>\n<td>金属谐波</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amplitude</td>\n<td>轻微 Tremolo</td>\n<td>明显颤动</td>\n<td>门控切割</td>\n<td>Ring Mod</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pan</td>\n<td>微妙移动</td>\n<td>声像摆动</td>\n<td>Auto-Pan</td>\n<td>空间效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wavetable Pos</td>\n<td>轻微色彩</td>\n<td>频谱运动</td>\n<td>剧变</td>\n<td>复杂频谱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PWM</td>\n<td>轻微厚实</td>\n<td>合唱感</td>\n<td>极端变化</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Vibrato 的标准参数（模拟人声/弦乐自然颤音）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Vibrato:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>7</mn><mtext> Hz</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>Depth</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>30</mn><mtext> cents</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Vibrato:} \\quad f_{lfo} = 5\\text{–}7\\ \\text{Hz}, \\quad \\text{Depth} = \\pm 10\\text{–}30\\ \\text{cents}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Vibrato:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hz</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Depth</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cents</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Tremolo 的标准参数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Tremolo:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>8</mn><mtext> Hz</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>Depth</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>6</mn><mtext> dB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Tremolo:} \\quad f_{lfo} = 4\\text{–}8\\ \\text{Hz}, \\quad \\text{Depth} = 3\\text{–}6\\ \\text{dB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Tremolo:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Hz</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Depth</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"延迟启动与-fade-in\">延迟启动与 Fade-In</h2><p>真实乐器的 Vibrato 不会从第一个音符就开始——它在音符稳定后逐渐出现。合成器通过 LFO Fade-In（延迟+淡入）模拟这一行为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LFO Depth</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LFO Depth}(t) = D_{target} \\cdot \\min\\left(1, \\frac{t - t_{delay}}{t_{fade}}\\right) \\quad (t &gt; t_{delay})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LFO Depth</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4221em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Delay</td>\n<td>200–500 ms</td>\n<td>等音符稳定后启动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fade-In</td>\n<td>300–800 ms</td>\n<td>渐进出现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fade-Out (Release)</td>\n<td>100–300 ms</td>\n<td>松键后渐退</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"多-lfo-与相位关系\">多 LFO 与相位关系</h2><p>高级合成器提供 2–4 个独立 LFO，每个可设不同速率、波形和目标。多 LFO 的交互创造了比单 LFO 丰富得多的运动模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>LFO1→Pitch + LFO2→Filter</td>\n<td>双重运动</td>\n<td>Vibrato + Wah 独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LFO1→LFO2 Rate</td>\n<td>加速/减速</td>\n<td>自然不规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LFO1→Pitch, LFO2→同 (不同相位)</td>\n<td>立体声去相关</td>\n<td>宽广 Vibrato</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LFO1 (慢) + LFO2 (快) 叠加到 Filter</td>\n<td>双速扫频</td>\n<td>大结构+细节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>复音 LFO（Poly LFO）与单音 LFO（Mono/Global LFO）的区别：Poly LFO 每个音符独立触发，相位独立——和弦演奏时每个音的调制不同步，产生更有机的复杂运动；Mono LFO 全局共享一个相位，所有音符被同步调制。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Poly LFO:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Poly LFO:} \\quad \\phi_i = 2\\pi f_{lfo} \\cdot (t - t_{note\\_on\\_i})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Poly LFO:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.117em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Mono LFO:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>t</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(全局)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Mono LFO:} \\quad \\phi = 2\\pi f_{lfo} \\cdot t \\quad \\text{(全局)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mono LFO:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全局</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Mono[&quot;Mono LFO&quot;]&#10;        ML[&quot;全局相位&lt;br/&gt;所有音符同步&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Poly[&quot;Poly LFO&quot;]&#10;        PL1[&quot;Note 1&lt;br/&gt;独立相位&quot;]&#10;        PL2[&quot;Note 2&lt;br/&gt;独立相位&quot;]&#10;        PL3[&quot;Note 3&lt;br/&gt;独立相位&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    ML --&gt; A[&quot;同步运动&lt;br/&gt;整体效果&quot;]&#10;    PL1 --&gt; B[&quot;独立运动&lt;br/&gt;有机复杂&quot;]&#10;    PL2 --&gt; B&#10;    PL3 --&gt; B\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Mono[\"Mono LFO\"]\n        ML[\"全局相位&lt;br/&gt;所有音符同步\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Poly[\"Poly LFO\"]\n        PL1[\"Note 1&lt;br/&gt;独立相位\"]\n        PL2[\"Note 2&lt;br/&gt;独立相位\"]\n        PL3[\"Note 3&lt;br/&gt;独立相位\"]\n    end\n    ML --&gt; A[\"同步运动&lt;br/&gt;整体效果\"]\n    PL1 --&gt; B[\"独立运动&lt;br/&gt;有机复杂\"]\n    PL2 --&gt; B\n    PL3 --&gt; B</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LFO 是工作在亚音频范围的调制源，输出不发声，而是周期性地驱动其他参数变化。</li>\n<li>波形决定了调制的运动形态，从正弦的平滑到 S&amp;H 的随机跳变，对应不同的音乐用途。</li>\n<li>同步速率让调制产生节奏相关效果，自由速率适合模仿自然 Vibrato 与硬件轻微漂移。</li>\n<li>LFO 的表现力取决于目标与深度的组合，Vibrato、Tremolo、Wah、Auto-Pan 都是同一原理的不同应用。</li>\n<li>Fade-In 与 Poly/Mono 相位关系进一步丰富了调制的自然性与复杂运动。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LFO 与周期调制","id":"lfo-与周期调制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"LFO 的基本概念与波形","id":"lfo-的基本概念与波形"},{"level":2,"text":"LFO 的速率与同步","id":"lfo-的速率与同步"},{"level":2,"text":"LFO 调制目标与深度","id":"lfo-调制目标与深度"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟启动与 Fade-In","id":"延迟启动与-fade-in"},{"level":2,"text":"多 LFO 与相位关系","id":"多-lfo-与相位关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ADSR 包络与时间塑形","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/oscillators-filters/envelope-adsr"},"next":{"title":"调制矩阵与路由架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/synthesizer-principles/modulation-routing/mod-matrix"}}